WEBVTT

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.976
And this guy is perfectly built
for holding his breath.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.976
He's six foot four. He's 160 pounds.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:09.976
And his total lung capacity
is twice the size of an average person.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.487
I'm six foot one, and fat.

00:08:13.577 --> 00:08:14.976
We'll say big-boned.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.976
(Laughter)

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.976
I had to drop 50 pounds in three months.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:25.510
So, everything that I put into my body,
I considered as medicine.

00:08:25.534 --> 00:08:29.976
Every bit of food was exactly
what it was for its nutritional value.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.976
I ate really small controlled portions
throughout the day.